error[E0214]: parameter 'x' has no type
 --> $DIR/untyped-lambda-declaration.nra:2:14
  |
2 | let f = func(x) => x;
  |              ^ a parameter takes the type that follows its group of names
  |
  = help: write ': <type>' after the last name of the group, as in 'func(a, b: int)'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0214`.
